{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "828323a15500900fd9f86d3e8337b68ee5e23a98270c7403dfee9eb09260a916", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんっ！\nグッモーニ～ン♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\nGood morning～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b26f96ddd3fec17ece24c87ae274efebe8017f4513b4b5f0b9fffbdafbab8ae6", "ja": "え？　グッモーニン……。\n急にどうしたんですか、青羽さん？", "zh": "咦？Good morning……\n青羽小姐，你怎么突然说英文？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "370121c13f8b1d84df757b43dd5ec325f901352e36f032c3b3c29976dfa00061", "ja": "えへへっ、じつは英会話に\nチャレンジしてみることにしたんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿，\n其实我决定要开始挑战学习英文会话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "91b3fed1396f78e9ae37abbbb72a766ca2cae492959eb5dc545a4e91ae7acaf0", "ja": "海外から来てくれるお客さんのために、\n英語くらいはしゃべれた方がいいですよね。", "zh": "为了服务从国外大老远来到剧场的观众，\n我想自己起码也要会说英文比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "bc35130fef83edb0bc6705b6e3b008cbf18d403c62dfd207c62ff89a3c2159ae", "ja": "ハロー、サンキュー、ウェルカ～ム♪\nみたいな感じで！", "zh": "Hello～Thank you～Welcome～♪\n就像这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f236a8eb9d048ae1ffcadfe0baba3f52c10159bfbc6ad074934255f0d28181f2", "ja": "はは、たしかに簡単な英語くらいは\n覚えておいた方がいいかもしれませんね。", "zh": "哈哈，\n至少学会简单的英文对话确实比较好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b1b1c6e5cbeb3a98dcd17efff1df5e09a5e996b22c8bbba1a3131500940d714e", "ja": "俺も、今のうちに勉強しておこうかな。\nいつか劇場が海外で有名になった時のためにも。", "zh": "我是不是也该趁现在学一下呢？\n好为将来剧场扬名国际时先做准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "5baac7b6bd550b2c7582fedc97dd79a315313c3579cc66f37d429e8be074f026", "ja": "きっとすぐだと思います♪　私もその時までに\n英語を覚えられるよう、頑張りますね！", "zh": "我想那个时刻一定很快就到了♪\n我也要努力在那之前学会英文！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "dfa31a5486b1342fec8518a82a052276eef0a41b202dffe8fb987e42483e5e2c", "ja": "あっ、そういえば！　社長さんから、\nとーっても大切なお話があるそうです！", "zh": "啊，话说回来！\n社长说，他有非～常重要的事要跟你说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5165e46ce45e03179db92e2cf66acb0803594165f1bba0e5c35db97dcc448aa9", "ja": "とーっても大切な話ですか。\n一体なんだろう……。事務所に行ってきますね！", "zh": "非～常重要的事吗？\n到底是什么事呢……那我去一趟事务所！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "8d441ea94fd4770200a600e36bce2d3bc0f3d8550dc80daf87011ebf130dde26", "ja": "はーい、行ってらっしゃ～い♪　……英語で、\n「行ってらっしゃい」って、なんて言うのかな？", "zh": "好的～请慢走～♪\n……英文的「请慢走」要怎么说呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "c8e006fbc0af05140704571cad440ce1b55e1739c74ccd52dfcab648a95cbc11", "ja": "行ってらっしゃい……イッテラッシャーイ……。\nぜったい違うよね。あとで調べてみようっと！", "zh": "请慢走……清慢揍……\n一定不是这样讲，等下去查查看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c123fb6d1832ab5e4c67ae3639f7b46ec372dd5a2a34932a6a4ccd98541eed96", "ja": "おはようございま……。", "zh": "早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1014_se", "source_sha256": "beb760521a71ac384ce3ccadffa71c877607ec858b436e27e4b4515625c41aea", "ja": "カコンッ", "zh": "喀哐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "3708a7bac8599c055f6bc1174d96f0fdea9edbea089fd0ea6ac91f68ca709d0f", "ja": "ナイスショット、社長！", "zh": "社长这球真漂亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "d64961cf5b4d7a1479aaeaa570b7dcbb84ddb34f49ef30bce8102e825e731a03", "ja": "ふふふ。私のパターも、\nまだまだ捨てたものではないようだね！", "zh": "呵呵呵，\n看来我的推杆还宝刀未老呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "23b6889c70cba41115d4a12ad5d6ad176db3d4730f6d2096675db456a5b73435", "ja": "……ええと、社長。\nどうして社長室でパターの練習を……？", "zh": "……那个，社长，\n请问你为什么在社长室练习推杆……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "83d2ea3b3aabe45ba94fdc9374ef49195f2dbfa03f727310abffbd0c95d8c73c", "ja": "あ、おはようございます！\nふふっ、実はですね……。", "zh": "啊，早安！\n呵呵，其实呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "4bd8ab514b486f66355ebd092cc09bf329bef68368f0ee089cb4556b2fd57991", "ja": "今度、全国のアイドル事務所の社長が集まって、\nゴルフ大会をするんだそうです！", "zh": "听说最近会集结全国偶像事务所的社长，\n举办一场高尔夫大赛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "93e043f2296c48944ac217bbb6a2c523cc24d5546d7e30c56b278b2759481459", "ja": "ゴルフ大会……！", "zh": "高尔夫大赛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "a707326b38bd89ff3f3a18f6b6f3481f4758a90d071ab04d1ec6366bd265a6b3", "ja": "そう！　彼らは皆、私と競い合うライバルではあるが、\n同時に肩を並べて走り合う仲間でもあるからね。", "zh": "没错！虽然他们都是我的竞争对手，\n但同时也是并肩前进的伙伴嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "4c703446608f48de933ee012aaeac913f426746f4f7ad1de1df2c8143cba1b0d", "ja": "こういった機会に、\nより親交を深めたいと思っているのだよ！", "zh": "我打算趁这次机会，\n和大家培养出更深厚的感情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d79c62ef142e1dbd81aa2abfbe271bf1865f7e86ebd4ea2036e82a02edc89f11", "ja": "そうですか。ゴルフ……楽しそうですね……。\nいや、お付き合いも大変ですね。頑張ってください！", "zh": "这样啊，高尔夫……感觉很好玩呢……\n不，应酬想必也很辛苦，请社长加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "e24459a5cb8d72fe57d6efa68fffd358788a32fa32af9962ba65a4232aa02495", "ja": "うむ。……それにしても、こうして\nパター練習をしていると、昔を思い出すよ。", "zh": "嗯……话说回来，\n像这样练习推杆，就会回忆起往事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "d3780a2c5adc51052af4c975b9a4158055936dcec8048c7041dac2de26ed80ca", "ja": "『パットの手品師』と呼ばれていた頃のことをね！\nそう、あれは私が765プロを立ち上げる前のこと……", "zh": "想当年，我可是被称为『推杆魔术师』！\n没有错，那是在我成立765艺能事务所前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "98f3a2705736b7a5f58566a9e494db84636d6ab19b050c5b6713252584d7f778", "ja": "あ、社長！　そういえば{$P$}さんに\n大切なお話があるんでしたよね？", "zh": "啊，社长！社长不是要跟{$P$}先生\n说一件很重要的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "e217a26e4d7e0bab69f29fe83635ed8237aeaee42df2368449af42a4761fab71", "ja": "おおっと、そうだった！\nでは、ゴルフ話はまたの機会にするとして……。", "zh": "哎呀，对喔！\n那下次有机会再讲高尔夫的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "99370b8a8c75dc1e992aecf02ba58d0eafff83466508a8ec3ef6ded75fcb73df", "ja": "うぉっほん！　話というのは他でもない。\n劇場の次の公演についてなんだが……。", "zh": "咳咳！我要说的不是别的，\n是关于剧场的下一次公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "2e3b2ff72e3bf61c6cd7dd0be813010cad9c854699df2e418dd6b22cffca0a7e", "ja": "天海君達『765PRO ALLSTARS』の全員が出演\nする公演を、大々的に催したいと考えているのだよ！", "zh": "我打算盛大举办一场公演，\n由天海等『765PRO ALLSTARS』所有成员一同演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "7344b91c11cabd930fb1db8e2bc77de53242a770a86b8ffc653487853d89d49d", "ja": "『765PRO ALLSTARS』全員……。\n春香たち13人の公演を、劇場でですか？", "zh": "『765PRO ALLSTARS』所有成员……\n要在剧场举办春香她们13人的公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "d79f8f03f9a5aa7ad5a07613e1b860195e1daa98cb30c3af49e26db4a5ce6bcf", "ja": "その通り！\nそしてその公演の名は、ズバリ！", "zh": "正是如此！\n而公演的名称就是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1032_101kot", "source_sha256": "c57e0c5d8bcbf639b3ec6429faf8166d931b2b0c2d3d2c892450ea1d8e75bd42", "ja": "『オールスターライブ』だそうです！", "zh": "社长说要叫『群星演唱会』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "c08da2d8c534a6a00416a940e838ab64917ee24c1ea7e00e0f2834de5c41f25e", "ja": "あああっ、音無君！？\nそれは私が言いたかったのに！？", "zh": "啊啊啊，音无！？\n那句话我本来想自己说的耶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1034_101kot", "source_sha256": "516b9e4c1849879116bd742b7483b0f0bc79e123ed2a00374d9f242e31365378", "ja": "うふふっ、ごめんなさい！\nでも、私も楽しみで、つい……♪", "zh": "呵呵，对不起！\n但我太期待了，一不小心就……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "6164ac670a822b6ab3105d8ace80815d7a5bd9d082e6d616a9e3188da975ac79", "ja": "オールスターライブ……！　なるほど、\nたしかに待ち望んでいたファンも多そうです。", "zh": "群星演唱会……！\n原来如此，应该也有很多粉丝期待着这样的表演呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1036_101kot", "source_sha256": "ccd9c9bd91f041302fc6caff8129ba58ab45fd7ffd42d5bddf3c1e6d3a5bc1c8", "ja": "しかも社長ったら、このライブを思いついてすぐ、\n新曲まで発注しちゃったんですよ！", "zh": "而且社长他呀，一决定要办这场演唱会，\n就马上把新歌发包出去了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1037_president", "source_sha256": "a1cc1b49571e1136616f892bdda81a3a8ab1d01790a0c4dd9baa946f3909c8da", "ja": "ああ、その曲も、ちょうど用意できたところだ。\n今の彼女達に相応しい曲になったと思うよ！", "zh": "没错，那首歌恰巧也完成了。\n是非常适合现在的她们的一首曲子喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1038_p", "source_sha256": "55038b373c13837c947d500e5bd3dcbc21d958c0d615e483338cfea3d947b09a", "ja": "おお、それは楽しみです！", "zh": "喔喔，那还真令人期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1039_101kot", "source_sha256": "ef8ad38e8a79b0e32250efe178218a4e82bd1fabdd2b12178fa033db1b5613f2", "ja": "私も今回のライブ、本当に楽しみにしています。\n頑張ってくださいね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我也相当很期待这次的演唱会。\n要加油喔，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_1040", "source_sha256": "4c7ab73a07d7c34dd280e5ed19ce5d4188f02f416ddf625f97131c91e9def6da", "ja": "……全力で！", "zh": "……全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "ce66ba7ed8a58460c7d90f8f5086cf50514da0c3d8ae03b7c7d027647d5452e2", "ja": "……はい！　全力を尽くします！", "zh": "……好的！我会全力以赴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "2d9e93cbd1f9462ef461d8ddd5b108fe031abf2ad5aa744a042d22fa1207fbab", "ja": "うむ！　このオールスターライブは、\n天海君達にとっても、ひとつの節目になるだろう。", "zh": "嗯！想必这场群星演唱会\n也会成为天海她们的一大里程碑吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "f06868bb20c71364bdea2538b3664ded58de11a9b8b92332691b665cb7af8cb6", "ja": "アイドル諸君との絆を信じ、\n頑張ってくれたまえ！　頼んだよ！", "zh": "相信自己和偶像们之间的羁绊，好好努力吧！\n交给你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "b6554dd33862f051e03f0f5c596704e7f81651b21754e24190fbf8a0b264c623", "ja": "（オールスターライブ……たしかに、今の春香たち\n13人の集大成であり、新たな門出になりそうだ）", "zh": "（群星演唱会……这的确会成为春香她们13人现阶段的\n集大成之作，同时应该也是一个新的起点。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "b30c91de16a0577b868881a15f73c9340c758450c7aa973169eb7a1a8484543a", "ja": "（これまでの経験を全て活かして、\n公演を成功へ導こう！）", "zh": "（好好运用至今的所有经验，\n让公演圆满成功吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
